    {
      "source": "Create a new <a href=\"FileSystemGeneratedFiles.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aot.generate\"><code>FileSystemGeneratedFiles</code></a> instance with all files\nstored under the root provided by the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Function.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Function</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的<a href=\"FileSystemGeneratedFiles.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aot.generate\"><code>FileSystemGeneratedFiles</code></a>实例，其中所有文件都存储在由给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Function.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Function</code></a>提供的根目录下。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <a href=\"FileSystemGeneratedFiles.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aot.generate\"><code>FileSystemGeneratedFiles</code></a> instance with all files\nstored under the specific <code>root</code>. The following subdirectories are\ncreated for the different file <a href=\"GeneratedFiles.Kind.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.aot.generate\"><code>kinds</code></a>:\n<ul>\n<li><code>sources</code></li>\n<li><code>resources</code></li>\n<li><code>classes</code></li>\n</ul>",
      "translation": "创建一个新的 <a href=\"FileSystemGeneratedFiles.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aot.generate\"><code>FileSystemGeneratedFiles</code></a> 实例，将所有文件存储于特定的 <code>root</code> 下。为不同的文件 <a href=\"GeneratedFiles.Kind.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.aot.generate\"><code>kinds</code></a> 创建以下子目录：\n<ul>\n<li><code>sources</code></li>\n<li><code>resources</code></li>\n<li><code>classes</code></li>\n</ul>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"GeneratedFiles.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.aot.generate\"><code>GeneratedFiles</code></a> implementation that stores generated files using a\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/nio/file/FileSystem.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.nio.file\"><code>FileSystem</code></a>.",
      "translation": "`<a href=\"GeneratedFiles.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.aot.generate\"><code>GeneratedFiles</code></a>` 实现，使用 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/nio/file/FileSystem.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.nio.file\"><code>FileSystem</code></a>` 存储生成的文件。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <a href=\"FileSystemGeneratedFiles.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aot.generate\"><code>FileSystemGeneratedFiles</code></a> instance with all files\nstored under the specific <code>root</code>.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的<code>FileSystemGeneratedFiles</code><a href=\"FileSystemGeneratedFiles.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aot.generate\">实例</a>，将所有文件存储在该特定<code>root</code>下。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Handle a generated file of the specified <a href=\"GeneratedFiles.Kind.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.aot.generate\"><code>GeneratedFiles.Kind</code></a> with the given\n<a href=\"GeneratedFiles.FileHandler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aot.generate\">handler</a>.",
      "translation": "处理生成的、指定了给定 <a href=\"GeneratedFiles.Kind.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.aot.generate\"><code>GeneratedFiles.Kind</code></a> 的文件，以及该 <a href=\"GeneratedFiles.FileHandler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aot.generate\">handler</a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"GeneratedFiles.html#handleFile(org.springframework.aot.generate.GeneratedFiles.Kind,java.lang.String,org.springframework.util.function.ThrowingConsumer)\">GeneratedFiles</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"GeneratedFiles.html#handleFile(org.springframework.aot.generate.GeneratedFiles.Kind,java.lang.String,org.springframework.util.function.ThrowingConsumer)\">GeneratedFiles</a></code></span>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Handle a generated file of the specified <a href=\"GeneratedFiles.Kind.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.aot.generate\"><code>GeneratedFiles.Kind</code></a> with the given\n<a href=\"GeneratedFiles.FileHandler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aot.generate\">handler</a>. The file handler lets you consume\nthe content of the already generated file, if any and provide a way\nto override its content if necessary.",
      "translation": "处理指定 <a href=\"GeneratedFiles.Kind.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.aot.generate\"><code>GeneratedFiles.Kind</code></a> 的生成文件，并使用给定的\n<a href=\"GeneratedFiles.FileHandler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aot.generate\">handler</a>。文件处理器允许您消费已生成文件的任何内容，并在必要时提供一种覆盖其内容的方法。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"GeneratedFiles.html#handleFile(org.springframework.aot.generate.GeneratedFiles.Kind,java.lang.String,org.springframework.util.function.ThrowingConsumer)\">handleFile</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"GeneratedFiles.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.aot.generate\">GeneratedFiles</a></code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"GeneratedFiles.html#handleFile(org.springframework.aot.generate.GeneratedFiles.Kind,java.lang.String,org.springframework.util.function.ThrowingConsumer)\">handleFile</a></code>` 接口 `<code><a href=\"GeneratedFiles.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.aot.generate\">GeneratedFiles</a></code>` 中",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>roots</code> - a function that returns the root to use for the given\n<a href=\"GeneratedFiles.Kind.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.aot.generate\"><code>GeneratedFiles.Kind</code></a>",
      "translation": "`roots` - 一个函数，返回用于给定 <a href=\"GeneratedFiles.Kind.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.aot.generate\"><code>GeneratedFiles.Kind</code></a> 的根。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>handler</code> - a consumer of a <a href=\"GeneratedFiles.FileHandler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aot.generate\"><code>GeneratedFiles.FileHandler</code></a> for the file",
      "translation": "`handler` - 用于文件的 `<a href=\"GeneratedFiles.FileHandler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aot.generate\"><code>GeneratedFiles.FileHandler</code></a>` 的消费者。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
